{"seq":2,"slug":"transfer-cost-allocation-intransit-accounting","title":"调拨成本归集与在途记账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/interwarehouse-transfer-rebalance/intransit-accounting-bonded/transfer-cost-allocation-intransit-accounting","wordCount":3016,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"调拨成本归集与在途记账\">调拨成本归集与在途记账</h1><p>这批货从深圳保税仓发往洛杉矶海外仓，物理上走了 21 天，账上却必须做出选择：货值算谁的资产、运费算谁的成本、汇率波动记到哪里。境内调拨最多是内部账套之间的对倒，跨境调拨则会同时触发四件事——存货计价方法的连续滚动、关联方转移定价的合规要求、进口国完税价格的申报基础、以及外币资产的期末重估。四者共用一套原始数据（货值、运费、关税、汇率、数量），却各有各的规则，任何一处口径不一致都会在月结或海关稽查时暴露。本篇讲这套成本数据如何在调拨中被归集、切分与记账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-成本随货走-而不是随单走\">核心概念：成本随货走，而不是随单走</h2><p>调拨成本归集的第一原则是<strong>成本必须跟随实物移动</strong>。这不是会计偏好，而是 <a href=\"https://www.ifrs.org/issued-standards/list-of-standards/ias-2-inventories/\">IAS 2《存货》</a>（中国对应《企业会计准则第 1 号——存货》）的硬要求：存货成本包括采购价格、进口关税与其他税费、以及使存货达到目前场所和状态所发生的运输与装卸费用。一批货从 A 仓搬到 B 仓，账面单位成本在移动前后<strong>不应无故跳变</strong>，除非发生新的、应当资本化的支出（如重新包装、跨境运费）。</p>\n<p>这与普通销售出库形成对比。销售出库时成本从存货转为营业成本，账面资产减少；调拨出库时成本只是从一个库存地点转移到另一个，<strong>总资产不变</strong>。因此调拨的成本分录天然是一对&quot;转出—转入&quot;，中间夹一个<strong>在途存货</strong>科目承接真空期：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>源仓</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>在途</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>目的仓</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>企业总存货</mtext></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>无差异时恒成立</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{源仓}} + V_{\\text{在途}} + V_{\\text{目的仓}} = V_{\\text{企业总存货}} \\quad (\\text{无差异时恒成立})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">源仓</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">在途</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">目的仓</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">企业总存货</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">无差异时恒成立</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第二原则是<strong>计价方法决定归集逻辑</strong>。移动加权平均（SAP 中价格控制码 V）下每次收货重算单位成本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>新</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>入</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>入</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>入</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{新}} = \\frac{c_0 \\cdot Q_0 + c_{\\text{入}} \\cdot Q_{\\text{入}}}{Q_0 + Q_{\\text{入}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">新</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">入</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">入</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">入</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而标准成本（价格控制码 S）下，收货按标准价入账，实际与标准的差额走<strong>价格差异科目</strong>，不进入存货；先进先出（FIFO）则按批次逐层结转。同一张调拨单在三种方法下分录完全不同，所以成本归集的实现必须先绑定计价方法。</p>\n<p>第三原则是<strong>跨境场景下账面成本与完税价格是两套口径</strong>。账面成本服务于财务报表，完税价格服务于进口国海关估价，两者都以货值加运费为基础，但可加计/扣减的项目、关联交易的调整规则并不相同。把二者混为一谈，是跨境电商调拨最常见的合规缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在途存货的账务切分\">在途存货的账务切分</h2><p>在途记账要解决的核心问题是：源仓已发货、目的仓尚未收货这段时间里，这批货记在哪个科目、按谁的汇率、在哪个会计期间。通用做法是设置**在途存货（Goods in Transit）**中转科目，源仓发货时借记在途、贷记源仓存货，目的仓收货时借记目的仓存货、贷记在途。整个过程如图：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[源仓发货] --&gt; B[借:在途存货&lt;br/&gt;贷:源仓存货]&#10;  B --&gt; C{跨境?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[关联方开票&lt;br/&gt;内部应收/应付]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[无内部结算]&#10;  D --&gt; F[申报清关&lt;br/&gt;关税/进口VAT]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[目的仓收货]&#10;  G --&gt; H[借:目的仓存货&lt;br/&gt;贷:在途存货]&#10;  H --&gt; I{成本需调整?}&#10;  I --&gt;|运费/关税待补| J[追加资本化]&#10;  I --&gt;|无| K[结转完成]&#10;  J --&gt; K\">graph TD\n  A[源仓发货] --&gt; B[借:在途存货&lt;br/&gt;贷:源仓存货]\n  B --&gt; C{跨境?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[关联方开票&lt;br/&gt;内部应收/应付]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[无内部结算]\n  D --&gt; F[申报清关&lt;br/&gt;关税/进口VAT]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[目的仓收货]\n  G --&gt; H[借:目的仓存货&lt;br/&gt;贷:在途存货]\n  H --&gt; I{成本需调整?}\n  I --&gt;|运费/关税待补| J[追加资本化]\n  I --&gt;|无| K[结转完成]\n  J --&gt; K</pre><p>分录的科目对照关系如下表。它把前一篇 <a href=\"../transfer-order-execution/transfer-order-model-state-machine\">调拨单数据模型与状态机</a> 定义的状态，映射成会计上真实发生的借贷动作，两张表共用同一批数量字段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>业务时点</th>\n<th>借方</th>\n<th>贷方</th>\n<th>金额基础</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>源仓发货</td>\n<td>在途存货</td>\n<td>源仓存货</td>\n<td>发货数量 × 源仓单位成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨境关联结算</td>\n<td>内部应收</td>\n<td>内部收入（按转移价）</td>\n<td>转移价格 × 数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关务完成</td>\n<td>在途存货（加计关税）</td>\n<td>应交税费/应付关税</td>\n<td>完税价格 × 税率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目的仓收货</td>\n<td>目的仓存货</td>\n<td>在途存货</td>\n<td>收货数量 × 源单位成本 + 分摊费用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>差异确认</td>\n<td>待处理财产损溢</td>\n<td>在途存货</td>\n<td>在途数量 − 收货数量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>期间切分（cutoff）</strong> 是这套结构里最容易出错的地方。发货在 12 月 31 日、收货在次年 1 月 5 日的调拨，期末必须在在途科目挂账，而不是让源仓的存货凭空消失。切分依据是<strong>权责发生时点</strong>而非物理到达：<a href=\"https://iccwbo.org/business-solutions/incoterms-rules/\">Incoterms 2020</a>（国际商会发布的国际贸易术语）条款决定了风险与成本的转移点，<code>FOB</code> 下越过船舷即转出，<code>DDP</code> 下到达目的地方转出。把 Incoterms 条款作为在途记账的<strong>开关字段</strong>而非靠人工判断，是防止跨期错账的关键设计。</p>\n<p><strong>外币在途</strong>还要叠加汇率规则。以 <a href=\"https://www.ifrs.org/issued-standards/list-of-standards/ias-21-the-effects-of-changes-in-foreign-exchange-rates/\">IAS 21《汇率变动的影响》</a> 为基准，非货币性存货项目按<strong>交易日汇率</strong>折算入账，期末不重估。这意味着在途存货一旦按发货日汇率记入，后续汇率波动不改变其账面值；但它对应的<strong>内部应收/应付</strong>是货币性项目，期末必须按收盘汇率重估，差额进汇兑损益。若系统对在途存货也做期末重估，就会凭空制造存货价值波动——跨境调拨实现中的典型反模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调拨成本的构成与分摊\">调拨成本的构成与分摊</h2><p>一笔跨境调拨的单位成本并不等于源仓的账面单价。它要在源仓货值基础上<strong>资本化</strong>若干附加费用，才能反映货到达目的仓时的真实成本。下表列出可资本化与不可资本化的项目——界线由 IAS 2 划定：使存货达到当前场所和状态所必需的费用进成本，过后发生的进当期损益。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>费用项</th>\n<th>是否资本化</th>\n<th>归集依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>源仓货值</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>源仓单位成本 × 发出数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨境干线运费、燃油附加</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>承运账单，按分摊规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口关税、反倾销税、消费税</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>完税价格 × 税率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保险费</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>保单金额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中转仓装卸、加固、换标</td>\n<td>是（重塑状态）</td>\n<td>服务商账单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口增值税（可抵扣）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>计入应交税费，不进存货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目的仓入库后的仓储费</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>当期损益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滞港费、查验费（非必需）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>当期损益</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分摊方法的选择直接决定单个 SKU 的成本精度，三种主流方法各有适用面：<strong>按价值分摊</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i = v_i / \\sum_j v_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 适合运费与货值强相关的普货；<strong>按重量/体积分摊</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i = w_i / \\sum_j w_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 适合重货或泡货混装，与实际承运计费口径一致；<strong>按数量分摊</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i = q_i / \\sum_j q_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 仅当各 SKU 单位重量价值相近时才合理。</p>\n<p>无论哪种方法，<strong>分摊基数必须在分摊前冻结</strong>。若一堆货里先到的 SKU 未等到全部重量数据就完成分摊，后补录的数据会导致已入库成本被追溯调整。工程做法是把分摊放到<strong>费用单据与调拨行全部关联齐全</strong>之后执行一次，未齐则挂在&quot;待分摊在途&quot;状态，不产生目的仓分录。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境转移定价与完税价格的双重合规\">跨境转移定价与完税价格的双重合规</h2><p>跨境调拨若发生在<strong>关联方</strong>（如同一集团的中国子公司与德国子公司）之间，就同时落入两套监管：<a href=\"https://www.oecd.org/tax/transfer-pricing/\">OECD 转让定价指南</a> 要求关联交易定价符合<strong>独立交易原则（arm&#39;s length principle）</strong>，即定价应与无关联第三方之间一致；而进口国海关则依据 <a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/tratop_e/cusval_e/cusval_e.htm\">WTO《海关估价协定》</a> 以<strong>成交价格</strong>为基础审定完税价格。二者冲突在于：税务上压低转移价可少缴所得税，海关上压低申报价可少缴关税，但两个方向相反，<strong>同一笔调拨很难同时取悦两个机关</strong>。</p>\n<p>中国的落地依据是《海关审定进出口货物完税价格办法》（海关总署令第 213 号），它对关联交易申报价设定<strong>测试价格</strong>要求：若特殊关系影响了成交价格，海关可拒绝申报价并重新估价。合规做法是准备<strong>转移定价文档</strong>（master file / local file / CbCR 三层结构），使两个口径可相互印证。</p>\n<p>跨境调拨的定价策略还要考虑 <a href=\"https://iccwbo.org/business-solutions/incoterms-rules/\">Incoterms 2020</a> 对计价口径的影响：<code>FOB</code> 报价不含国际运费与保险，完税价格需在 FOB 基础上加计运费与保险；<code>DDP</code> 报价已含关税，则完税价格需<strong>扣减</strong>其中包含的关税与进口环节税，否则会重复计税。下表把两种口径的调整方向并置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>账面转移成本</th>\n<th>海关完税价格</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>货物本身价值</td>\n<td>含</td>\n<td>含</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>国际运费 + 保险</td>\n<td>FOB 含则计入</td>\n<td>FOB 下加计至 CIF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口关税</td>\n<td>视条款</td>\n<td>扣减（若价内已含）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特许权使用费</td>\n<td>视是否与货相关</td>\n<td>与进口货相关的须加计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口 VAT</td>\n<td>不进存货</td>\n<td>不计入完税价格</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>任一环节的错配都会在海关稽查或转让定价审计中被追缴。因此系统的设计目标不是&quot;算出一个数&quot;，而是<strong>保留从源仓货值到完税价格的可追溯调整链</strong>：每个调整项有独立字段、单据与审批，两个口径都由这条链派生，而非各自手工录入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"系统实现-分录引擎-汇率与差异\">系统实现：分录引擎、汇率与差异</h2><p>把上述规则落成代码，核心是一个<strong>事件驱动的分录引擎</strong>：前一篇定义的 <a href=\"../transfer-order-execution/transfer-order-model-state-machine\">调拨单状态机</a> 每发生一次转移（<code>SHIPPED</code>、<code>CUSTOMS_CLEARED</code>、<code>RECEIVED</code>），就投递一个领域事件，引擎按计价方法 + Incoterms + 关务状态查表生成借贷分录，让业务事实与会计规则解耦。每笔分录带唯一键 <code>(transfer_id, leg_id, event_type, attempt_no)</code> 保证幂等，重复的承运商回调不会重复过账。</p>\n<p>汇率处理要区分<strong>记账汇率</strong>与<strong>结算汇率</strong>：发货日汇率用于在途存货入账，结算日汇率用于内部应收应付核销，差额进汇兑损益。系统需维护按币种、按日期的汇率表，并在分录上<strong>冻结所用汇率值</strong>，而非引用实时汇率，以保证已过账分录可重现。在途科目余额则定期与&quot;已发货未收货&quot;的调拨行明细核对，久悬余额进入异常队列人工处置。</p>\n<p><strong>差异处理</strong>是调拨成本归集的收口。当 <code>received_qty &lt; shipped_qty</code>（运输损耗、清关扣货），差额既影响数量也影响成本：在途余额必须冲平，差额按原因走&quot;待处理财产损溢&quot;或向承运人索赔。单位成本会因分摊基数变小而重算——实务中通常对<strong>未收货部分单独重算</strong>，不追溯已收货 SKU。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>调拨成本归集的第一原则是<strong>成本随货走</strong>：调拨是资产在库存地点间的转移，总资产不变，中间以<strong>在途存货科目</strong>承接真空期。</li>\n<li><strong>计价方法</strong>（移动加权平均 / 标准成本 / FIFO）决定归集逻辑；跨境场景下账面成本与完税价格是<strong>两套口径</strong>，不得混用。</li>\n<li><strong>期间切分</strong>应以 Incoterms 条款作为可计算开关，外币在途存货按<strong>交易日汇率</strong>入账且期末不重估，只有货币性的内部应收应付才做期末重估。</li>\n<li><strong>成本构成</strong>由 IAS 2 划界：达到当前场所状态所必需者资本化，过后发生者进损益；分摊方法按价值/重量/数量选择，且<strong>分摊基数必须冻结</strong>。</li>\n<li>跨境关联调拨同时受 <a href=\"https://www.oecd.org/tax/transfer-pricing/\">OECD 转让定价指南</a> 与 <a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/tratop_e/cusval_e/cusval_e.htm\">WTO 海关估价协定</a> 约束，系统要保留从源仓货值到完税价格的<strong>可追溯调整链</strong>。</li>\n<li>实现上采用<strong>事件驱动的分录引擎</strong>，冻结记账汇率，以唯一幂等键防重复过账，并对久悬在途余额定期对账。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"调拨成本归集与在途记账","id":"调拨成本归集与在途记账"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：成本随货走，而不是随单走","id":"核心概念-成本随货走-而不是随单走"},{"level":2,"text":"在途存货的账务切分","id":"在途存货的账务切分"},{"level":2,"text":"调拨成本的构成与分摊","id":"调拨成本的构成与分摊"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境转移定价与完税价格的双重合规","id":"跨境转移定价与完税价格的双重合规"},{"level":2,"text":"系统实现：分录引擎、汇率与差异","id":"系统实现-分录引擎-汇率与差异"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"在途库存模型与所有权转移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/interwarehouse-transfer-rebalance/intransit-accounting-bonded/intransit-inventory-ownership-transfer"},"next":{"title":"跨境调拨的保税监管与关务处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/interwarehouse-transfer-rebalance/intransit-accounting-bonded/crossborder-bonded-customs-transfer"}}